            "id": 6669672,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 思佳訊半導體(SWKS-US)大跌5.02%，報74.71美元",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>思佳訊半導體(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:SWKS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/SWKS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">SWKS-US</a>)截至台北時間21日04:53股價下跌3.95美元，報74.71美元，跌幅5.02%，成交量1,852,175（股），盤中最高價79.07美元、最低價74.70美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-2%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-3.77%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-5.18%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-10.76%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>思佳訊半導體(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:SWKS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/SWKS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">SWKS-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：-8.44%</li> <li>近 1 月：+2.74%</li> <li>近 3 月：+20.37%</li> <li>近 6 月：+17.17%</li> <li>今年以來：+30%</li></ul></section></main>",
